<section id="privacy" style="padding:3rem clamp(1rem,3vw,2rem);max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto">
  <h2 style="font-size:1.15rem;margin-bottom:.5rem">Privacy Policy</h2>
  <p style="font-size:.92rem;line-height:1.6;opacity:.85">We collect only the information you voluntarily provide through our quote form &mdash; your name, contact details and a short description of the job. It is used solely to respond to your enquiry and prepare a quote. We never sell or share your details with third parties, and you can ask us to delete them at any time.</p>
</section>
<section id="terms" style="padding:3rem clamp(1rem,3vw,2rem);max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto">
  <h2 style="font-size:1.15rem;margin-bottom:.5rem">Terms of Service</h2>
  <p style="font-size:.92rem;line-height:1.6;opacity:.85">Quotes are provided free of charge and are valid for 30 days. All work is carried out by licensed and insured trades to Australian standards. Payment terms are agreed in writing before work begins, and any variation is quoted and approved before it proceeds.</p>
</section>
